📋 [阶段规划 5/5 · interfaces] breakout_interface
   组件: 0 个  |  Pipeline: 0 条  |  Interface: 1 个

   📦 组件:

   🖥️  Interfaces:
      1. breakout_engine (cli)
         → Deliver a runnable 2D Breakout game engine interface. It exposes two frozen routes: 'step_breakout_simulation' (interactive frame-by-frame stepping) and 'run_headless_breakout' (headless full game run). The interface supports two modes selected by optional CLI flags: '--mode interactive' (default) opens a pygame window and repeatedly calls 'step_breakout_simulation' with commands built from keyboard input; '--mode headless' invokes 'run_headless_breakout' once with configurable max_frames, seed, screenshot_path, summary_path and then exits. Other flags: --max-frames, --seed, --screenshot, --summary. The adapter must only orchestrate and must not know any concrete Model/Provider/Service class paths.

